        "exercise": 2,
        "pages": "124",
        "task": "Rewrite the sentences, then transcribe them as you pronounce them",
        "method": "Read each sentence as linked speech. Alif waṣl is silent inside it. Moon: keep l; sun: skip l and double the next letter. These examples are opening excerpts: keep their endings because the book's sentences continue.",
        "example": {
          "ar": "هَرَبَ الْقِطُّ",
          "translit": "ha ra bal qiṭ ṭu",
